{"id": "JAH-SIG-COMPUTEC-000001", "slug": "tool-compute-capacity-optimizer-signature", "title": "Compute Capacity Optimizer \u2014 Overview and definition", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Balances workloads against processing, memory, power, and time limits. The Compute Capacity Optimizer fits workloads into limited capacity: given jobs with CPU, memory, and deadline requirements and a fixed cluster, it packs jobs to maximize throughput without violating any limit. It reports utilization per resource and identifies which limit binds first. A capacity-planning optimizer. Capability specification and design target: this database describes what the tool must do, not a claim of implementation or deployment. Defensive and engineering content only \u2014 no weapon-targeting or attack-execution content.", "capabilities": ["Multi-resource bin packing", "Deadline-aware scheduling", "Utilization reporting per resource", "Binding-constraint identification", "Overload warnings with options"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Tool overview and capability inventory", "code": "J({tool:TOOL.name,capabilities:TOOL.capabilities,count:TOOL.capabilities.length});assert(TOOL.capabilities.length>=5,'caps');", "verified_output": "{\"tool\":\"Compute Capacity Optimizer\",\"capabilities\":[\"Multi-resource bin packing\",\"Deadline-aware scheduling\",\"Utilization reporting per resource\",\"Binding-constraint identification\",\"Overload warnings with options\"],\"count\":5}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-darpa-nasa-grade-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8